---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import PunchCard from '../PunchCard.astro';
import SceneVideo from '../SceneVideo.astro';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[7];
---

<section 
  id="scene-8" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="eniac" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.precisionValue}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage layout-split">
    <!-- Cinematic Atmospheric Video Background (Aberdeen 1949 Vacuum Tubes & Silicon Dawn) -->
    <SceneVideo 
      src="/videos/08-eniac.mp4" 
      poster="/images/08-eniac.jpg" 
      blend="screen" 
      opacity={0.45} 
    />

    <!-- Left Column: Ramanujan Mystic Notebook & Archival Photo Card -->
    <div class="ramanujan-col choreo-header">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">08 // MADRAS Y CAMBRIDGE, 1914 · RAMANUJAN</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">El Sueño de Namagiri</h2>

        <!-- Archival Photo Card: Ramanujan at Cambridge Notebook -->
        <div class="archival-photo-card tilt-left" style="margin: 14px 0 16px 0;">
          <img src="/images/08-ramanujan.jpg" alt="Srinivasa Ramanujan con sus cuadernos matemáticos en Cambridge" loading="eager" />
          <div class="photo-caption">
            <span>S. RAMANUJAN · CUADERNO MODULAR</span>
            <span class="photo-badge">1914</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'Srinivasa Ramanujan afirmaba que la diosa Namagiri escribía fórmulas en su lengua mientras dormía. Entre ellas, una serie infinita con el factor 2√2/9801 que destroza la lentitud: con un solo término de cálculo clava 8 decimales exactos de golpe.'
            : 'Srinivasa Ramanujan declared the goddess Namagiri inscribed equations upon his tongue in dreams. Among them was an infinite series with prefactor 2√2/9801 that obliterated slowness: in a single step, it nails 8 exact decimals.'}
        </p>

        <div class="formula-blueprint blueprint-panel choreo-metrics" style="margin-top: 12px;">
          <span class="pill-formula">1/π = (2√2/9801) ∑ [(4k)!(1103 + 26390k)] / [(k!)⁴ 396⁴ᵏ]</span>
          <strong class="pill-val tabular">+8 dígitos / término</strong>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="beat beat-climax" data-beat="0.84-0.98">
        <blockquote class="eniac-quote">
          <p>«El cálculo manual había muerto. La era del silicio abría las compuertas del infinito.»</p>
          <cite>— George Reitwiesner &amp; John von Neumann (1949)</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: ENIAC Programmers & Tactical Punched Card Rig -->
    <div class="eniac-col choreo-artifact">
      <!-- Archival Photo Card: ENIAC Programmers -->
      <div class="archival-photo-card tilt-right" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
        <img src="/images/08-eniac.jpg" alt="Programadoras del ENIAC en Aberdeen 1949" loading="eager" />
        <div class="photo-caption">
          <span>KAY MCNULTY &amp; FRANCES BILAS · ENIAC</span>
          <span class="photo-badge">1949</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="museum-plate">
        [ FIG. 08 // ABERDEEN, 1949 — IBM 80-COL // 17,468 TUBOS — 2,037 DÍGITOS ]
      </div>

      <div class="beat beat-eniac" data-beat="0.40-0.80">
        <h3 class="sub-scene-title">ENIAC: 70 Horas para 2,037 Dígitos</h3>
        <p class="beat-text" style="font-size: 0.94rem;">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'En 1949, John von Neumann introdujo a π dentro de una bestia de 30 toneladas y 17,468 tubos de vacío. Durante el fin de semana del 4 de julio, las tarjetas perforadas devoraron 2,037 decimales en 70 horas continuas.'
            : 'In 1949, John von Neumann fed π into a 30-ton colossus of 17,468 vacuum tubes. Over the July 4th weekend, 80-column punch cards chewed out 2,037 exact decimals in 70 continuous hours.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Realtime IBM 80-Col PunchCard Hardware Rig -->
      <PunchCard />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #0d1a12 0%, #050a07 100%);
  }

  .ramanujan-col {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .eniac-col {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #39ff88;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
  }

  .sub-scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #39ff88;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-size: clamp(0.94rem, 1.6vw, 1.08rem);
    color: rgba(223, 211, 185, 0.88);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .formula-blueprint {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 136, 0.25) !important;
  }

  .pill-formula {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #39ff88;
  }

  .pill-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #ffd700;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .eniac-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #39ff88;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(57, 255, 136, 0.4);
  }

  .eniac-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: rgba(223, 211, 185, 0.6);
    margin-top: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
</style>
